    "body": "Sorry, I wasn't clear. `body.formData()` requires the `;boundary=<boundary>` parameter of the content type to parse, so parsing it without a content type is not an option. I think requiring folks use `new Response(stream, { headers }).formData()` is probably fine. (ie don't include form data in this proposal)",
