    "body": "ah right, forgot about that `boundary` parameter on the content-type. In that case, we either do as you suggest and limit it to `new Response(stream, { headers }).formData()` or allow for an `init` argument on `reader.formData()` to specify the content-type. As one may imagine implementing `new Response(stream, { headers }).formData()` using this reader, the latter could make sense.",
